# resume-exceptions.conf — named exceptions to the fresh-with-personas relaunch (inter#262).
# Copy to resume-exceptions.conf (gitignored, LIVE state) and list ONLY the seats that must
# resume their existing session at the next launch. Every other seat starts FRESH with its
# persona, wisdoms and RESUME handoff.
#
# Format:  persona | one-line reason (required — a line with no reason is ignored)
# Guards that still apply to every listed seat:
#   - a session whose transcript holds a structured refusal stop is never resumed;
#   - a quarantined session id (QUARANTINED_SIDS in launch-federation.sh) is never resumed.
#
# Example:
# qbp-implementor | mid-way through a multi-commit proof port; context not yet in RESUME.md
